        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 17-B5, Amber Glass Knob With Ribbon and Reed Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ribbon and Reed design is well known in French Colonial decor; and when it is paired with the Victorian Amber Glass knob it is a vision of old world grandeur. It is available in 3 finishes; and it will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/victorian-amber-glass-knob-fusion-17\"><b>More Rose Choices</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 17 Amber Victorian Knob with B5 Ribbon and Reed Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Designer Orange Glass Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Amber Victorian Glass Knob With Ribbon And Reed Rose, Fusion 17-B5",
                "description": "Ribbon and Reed Rose with Victorian Amber Knob Fusion 17-B5 - The Ribbon and Reed design is well known in French Colonial decor; and when it is paired with the Victorian Amber Glass knob it is a vision of old world grandeur. It is available in 3 finishes; and it will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
